WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.011 --> 00:00:14.372
Shock rippled through Zann.

2
00:00:14.392 --> 00:00:17.955
"I can't believe Laddno won."

3
00:00:17.975 --> 00:00:20.898
"Those numbers can't be right!"

4
00:00:21.458 --> 00:00:22.199
a man shouted.

5
00:00:22.219 --> 00:00:24.781
"I demand a recount!"

6
00:00:25.161 --> 00:00:25.902
a woman cried.

7
00:00:26.783 --> 00:00:29.705
Venna zapped away, along with Maff and a few others.

8
00:00:29.725 --> 00:00:32.147
"Do you think Laddno cheated?"

9
00:00:32.507 --> 00:00:33.148
Perda asked.

10
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:34.821
Fala shook her head.

11
00:00:34.841 --> 00:00:37.684
"Nobody can tamper with a vote toad.

12
00:00:38.164 --> 00:00:39.665
At least I don't think anyone can."

13
00:00:40.426 --> 00:00:42.068
She zapped off without another word.

14
00:00:42.888 --> 00:00:43.609
Gliss frowned.

15
00:00:43.629 --> 00:00:48.233
"Now that Laddno is king, will he release the prisoners soon?"

16
00:00:48.253 --> 00:00:51.016
"I'm sure he will," Darb assured her.

17
00:00:51.036 --> 00:00:53.638
"There's no reason for him to keep them locked up."

18
00:00:53.658 --> 00:00:55.280
"You're right."

19
00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:56.821
Zann felt restless.

20
00:00:56.841 --> 00:00:59.504
"But we need to tell someone about Morb.

21
00:00:59.948 --> 00:01:04.411
The longer we sit around here doing nothing, the more time he has to finish that contraption!"

22
00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:09.774
"Let's go back to the lab and keep looking for ideas about what to do," Perda suggested.

23
00:01:10.734 --> 00:01:11.514
They all agreed.

24
00:01:13.315 --> 00:01:18.318
But when they were standing outside the lab, Zann remembered the Shield spell that Mari and Venna had

25
00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:18.678
put up.

26
00:01:18.698 --> 00:01:20.600
"How are we going to get in?"

27
00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:21.320
he said.

28
00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:23.021
"Should we try to find Mari?"

29
00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:24.702
"There's no need to."

30
00:01:25.162 --> 00:01:26.103
Perda stepped forward.

31
00:01:26.123 --> 00:01:28.444
"I remember how she unlocked it."

32
00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:34.554
Seconds later they were inside.

33
00:01:35.294 --> 00:01:39.517
Zann grinned at Perda, impressed again by how adept she was at learning magic.

34
00:01:40.438 --> 00:01:42.460
"It's a good thing you guys are here," he said.

35
00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:47.664
"If it hadn't been for my birthday, you'd all be stuck in Swamp Bottom with no idea about

36
00:01:47.744 --> 00:01:53.128
Morb or missing relics or any of the rest of—" He stopped talking and gasped as a strong

37
00:01:53.168 --> 00:01:54.790
wave of magic energy hit him.

38
00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:57.352
An invisible force was pulling on him.

39
00:01:58.212 --> 00:02:00.714
"Hey!" Gliss grabbed a table for support.

40
00:02:00.734 --> 00:02:02.276
"What's happening?

41
00:02:02.816 --> 00:02:04.337
Is this part of the Shield spell?"

42
00:02:04.357 --> 00:02:07.157
"I don't think so," Perda said.

43
00:02:07.177 --> 00:02:10.278
"Not unless Mari forgot to mention this part."

44
00:02:11.099 --> 00:02:12.639
"It's pulling me toward the door!"

45
00:02:13.359 --> 00:02:16.580
Zann tried to hang onto a chair, but the magic was too strong.

46
00:02:17.321 --> 00:02:20.322
It pried his hands from the chair and dragged him outside.

47
00:02:20.862 --> 00:02:23.623
The magic herded Zann and his friends along the street.

48
00:02:24.483 --> 00:02:27.064
Only Zing didn't seem to be affected by the spell.

49
00:02:27.904 --> 00:02:32.768
The dragon followed, whistling frantically, as Zann and his friends were dragged toward the center of the city.

50
00:02:33.628 --> 00:02:37.711
Zann heard other people shouting; they too were being herded in the same direction.

51
00:02:37.731 --> 00:02:40.573
"What kind of spell is this?"

52
00:02:40.974 --> 00:02:41.514
Gliss cried.

53
00:02:41.534 --> 00:02:46.638
"I read about something like this in that book about off-world magic," Perda said.

54
00:02:46.658 --> 00:02:49.440
"I think it's a Compel spell.

55
00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:56.359
These spells were banned during the Days of Discipline, along with Flash Freezes and human search spells and

56
00:02:56.379 --> 00:02:58.199
the rest of the stuff that's illegal now."

57
00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:00.600
"Could Morb be doing this?"

58
00:03:01.101 --> 00:03:01.601
Gliss said.

59
00:03:01.621 --> 00:03:04.502
"I guess we'll find out," Darb said.

60
00:03:04.522 --> 00:03:06.803
"It's guiding us toward the palace."

61
00:03:08.064 --> 00:03:11.985
Moments later the kids were in the palace square, which was crowded with people.

62
00:03:12.786 --> 00:03:14.526
Most of them looked angry or confused.

63
00:03:14.546 --> 00:03:17.147
"This is outrageous!"

64
00:03:17.568 --> 00:03:18.268
a woman shouted.

65
00:03:19.048 --> 00:03:20.409
"Why have we all been dragged here?"

66
00:03:20.829 --> 00:03:21.489
a man yelled.

67
00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:23.811
Zann spotted Mari.

68
00:03:24.671 --> 00:03:28.773
He stepped toward her, relieved to find that the Compel spell had released him.

69
00:03:28.793 --> 00:03:30.234
"Hey, Mari!

70
00:03:30.654 --> 00:03:31.535
Do you know what's happening?"

71
00:03:32.395 --> 00:03:34.376
Mari turned to face Zann and his friends.

72
00:03:34.997 --> 00:03:35.597
She smiled.

73
00:03:35.617 --> 00:03:37.718
"You mean the weird spell?

74
00:03:38.459 --> 00:03:38.859
I don't know.

75
00:03:39.419 --> 00:03:40.900
But this is pretty exciting, huh?"

76
00:03:41.881 --> 00:03:44.062
Zann was surprised that she looked so happy.

77
00:03:44.742 --> 00:03:47.864
Before he could ask why, there was a commotion at the front of the crowd.

78
00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:51.382
Suddenly a tall, gold-colored stage appeared.

79
00:03:52.123 --> 00:03:54.785
Laddno walked onto it with a big grin on his face.

80
00:03:55.565 --> 00:03:57.287
He was wearing a ceremonial robe.

81
00:03:57.307 --> 00:03:59.488
"Welcome, citizens!"

82
00:04:00.569 --> 00:04:04.012
A Swelling spell allowed his voice to be heard over the noise of the crowd.

83
00:04:04.032 --> 00:04:05.953
"Thank you for coming!"

84
00:04:05.973 --> 00:04:09.215
"We didn't have much choice, did we?"

85
00:04:09.436 --> 00:04:10.056
a man yelled.

86
00:04:10.076 --> 00:04:15.240
"I'm honored to be your new king," Laddno said.

87
00:04:16.176 --> 00:04:18.437
His voice became louder as people booed.

88
00:04:18.457 --> 00:04:25.801
"Together we shall create a wonderful new future for Magica!"

89
00:04:26.762 --> 00:04:29.704
As Laddno continued to talk, Zann didn't pay much attention.

90
00:04:30.484 --> 00:04:34.947
He was too busy wondering how they could get word to the new king about Morb's return.

91
00:04:35.687 --> 00:04:40.670
Maybe when Laddno let Zann's parents and Boz out, the adults could help to get Laddno's attention.

92
00:04:41.470 --> 00:04:43.111
Suddenly Perda elbowed Zann.

93
00:04:43.131 --> 00:04:44.472
"Who's that?"

94
00:04:45.384 --> 00:04:47.125
A figure had appeared beside Laddno.

95
00:04:47.885 --> 00:04:50.606
A dark cloak hid the person's face from view.

96
00:04:51.466 --> 00:04:52.846
Laddno glanced at the figure.

97
00:04:52.866 --> 00:04:56.567
"Oh, right, I almost forgot," Laddno said.

98
00:04:56.587 --> 00:05:01.929
"The reason I called you here is to introduce you to my new associate, Brom.

99
00:05:02.409 --> 00:05:05.670
He will be, er, assisting me as I rule Magica."

100
00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:09.111
"Associate?" Gliss sounded confused.

101
00:05:09.131 --> 00:05:10.811
"What does he mean?"

102
00:05:10.831 --> 00:05:12.912
"And who's Brom?"

103
00:05:13.212 --> 00:05:13.852
Perda added.

104
00:05:14.348 --> 00:05:15.409
"I've never heard of him."

105
00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:17.070
Zann shrugged.

106
00:05:17.851 --> 00:05:21.134
Curious, he leaned forward as the stranger threw back his hood.

107
00:05:22.135 --> 00:05:23.096
Laddno smiled.

108
00:05:23.116 --> 00:05:28.961
"I'm sure everyone in Magica will enjoy getting to know my good friend Brom," he said.

109
00:05:28.981 --> 00:05:33.304
"You'll especially enjoy his vast and creative magical powers."

110
00:05:33.324 --> 00:05:35.506
"No way!"

111
00:05:35.967 --> 00:05:36.707
a woman shouted.

112
00:05:37.388 --> 00:05:39.490
"I don't even believe you won the election.

113
00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:42.644
I demand a recount."

114
00:05:42.664 --> 00:05:44.165
"Bring out the voting toads!"

115
00:05:44.646 --> 00:05:45.506
someone else yelled.

116
00:05:46.267 --> 00:05:47.928
The square erupted in noise.

117
00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:52.032
A few people started chanting Venna's name.

118
00:05:54.394 --> 00:05:56.255
Others continued to yell at Laddno.

119
00:05:56.275 --> 00:06:00.559
"Maybe we should get out of here," Gliss said.

120
00:06:00.579 --> 00:06:03.121
"Things are getting out of control."

121
00:06:03.861 --> 00:06:05.743
Perda's eyes were still on the stranger.

122
00:06:05.763 --> 00:06:09.186
"There's something about that guy," she muttered.

123
00:06:09.206 --> 00:06:11.788
"He has a weird look in his eyes."

124
00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:13.820
"Who? Laddno?"

125
00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:14.701
Zann asked.

126
00:06:15.861 --> 00:06:17.501
"No, Brom."

127
00:06:18.142 --> 00:06:19.302
Perda sounded uneasy.

128
00:06:19.322 --> 00:06:22.623
"Something about him reminds me of Ello."

129
00:06:23.323 --> 00:06:23.883
She gulped.

130
00:06:23.903 --> 00:06:32.185
"Not the real Ello, but when—" Just then Brom pushed forward, almost knocking Laddno off the stage.

131
00:06:32.205 --> 00:06:34.626
"Hey!" Laddno protested.

132
00:06:34.646 --> 00:06:37.647
"Enough of this charade," Brom said.

133
00:06:38.407 --> 00:06:41.428
He snapped his fingers, and suddenly his face changed.

134
00:06:43.308 --> 00:06:43.490
"Oh, no!"

135
00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:44.055
Gliss cried.
